      "normalizedSource": "With each call of [`view(_:shouldRenderAtTime:)`](skviewdelegate/view(_:shouldrenderattime:).md), it checks the time since the last render and if that value exceeds the required frame duration (`1 / fps`), the method returns [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) and the frame is rendered.",
